			"notes": "## v3.3\n\n- Added support for Minecraft 1.21.11 and 26.1.2.\n- Rebuilt the GUI with NanoVG: cleaner V3-style layout, vector controls and Pixelify Sans.\n- Position sliders now support values from -100 to 100.\n- Yaw, Pitch and Roll now rotate the held item around its own axis.\n- Added the No Equip toggle to disable the item draw animation.\n- Improved No Swing and Scale Swing transform handling."
		},
